stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> FreeFrame: BufferPoolManager Initialization

    FreeFrame --> PinnedFrame: fetch_page() / new_page()<br/>pin_count = 1, is_evictable = false
    
    PinnedFrame --> PinnedFrame: Concurrent Reader/Writer<br/>pin_count.fetch_add(1)
    
    PinnedFrame --> UnpinnedFrame: PageReadGuard / PageWriteGuard dropped<br/>pin_count.fetch_sub(1) == 0, is_evictable = true

    UnpinnedFrame --> PinnedFrame: Cache Hit fetch_page()<br/>pin_count = 1, reference_bit = true, is_evictable = false

    state ClockEvictionReplacer {
        [*] --> CheckRefBit
        CheckRefBit --> ClearRefBit: ref_bit == true<br/>Set ref_bit = false, advance hand
        ClearRefBit --> CheckRefBit: Check next victim frame
        CheckRefBit --> EvictVictim: ref_bit == false && pin_count == 0<br/>Select frame as victim!
    }

    UnpinnedFrame --> ClockEvictionReplacer: Pool Exhaustion (Need free frame)
    
    EvictVictim --> FlushToDisk: If is_dirty == true<br/>DiskManager::write_page()
    FlushToDisk --> FreeFrame: Page flushed to disk
    EvictVictim --> FreeFrame: If is_dirty == false
